==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Parasol Base (Enemy Base)|Parasol Base]].
*1 [[White Wind]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*2 [[Dark Wind]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**12 [[Dark Wind]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**8 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**12 [[Boulder]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**3 [[Boulder]]s spawn after 22 seconds<sup>660f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**Infinite [[White Wind]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**10 [[White Wind]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**5 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

